          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Here's what I found on Bangkok Prep's admissions and fees.\n\n## Admission process\n\nBangkok Prep is a British curriculum school. "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Its Primary campus (Early Years to Year 6) is next door to its Secondary campus (Year 7 to Year 13) on Sukhumvit 77."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " The steps are:\n\n1. **Enquiry.** "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You start by filling in a short enquiry form. The school then invites you for an introductory visit and tour."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n2. **Application.** "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If you decide on Bangkok Prep, you submit the application form and the required documents."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n3. **Assessment.** The length depends on your child's year level:\n   - "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Early Years: about 30–45 minutes"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n   - "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Years 1–2: about 1.5–2 hours"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n   - "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Years 3–6: about 2.5–3 hours of testing"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n   - "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Years 7–12: about 2.5–3 hours"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n   \n   Younger children attend a welcome session in a classroom. Older children take the CAT4 test.\n4. **Decision.** "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The school considers the assessment results, school reports and how many places are available."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Families hear back within 1–2 weeks."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n5. **Offer and enrolment.** "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If your child is accepted, you get a formal offer letter and an invoice for the initial fees (placement, security deposit and registration). These must be paid by the deadline to secure the place."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n6. **Visa support.** "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A Government Liaison Officer helps international families apply for students' Non-Ed visas and parents' visas."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n\n## Tuition fees\n\n**2025–2026 annual tuition** (from a third-party listing):\n| Year group | Fee (THB) |\n|---|---|\n| Daycare | 295,000 – 370,000 |\n| Nursery | 575,930 |\n| Reception | 609,003 |\n| Years 1–2 | 682,500 |\n| Years 3–4 | 703,500 |\n| Years 5–6 | 719,250 |\n| Year 7 | 756,000 |\n| Year 11 | 808,500 |\n| Year 12 | 821,100 |\n| Year 13 | 714,000 |\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": ""
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n\n**2026–2027:** A review site citing the school's website gives "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "annual tuition from THB 384,800 (Pre-Nursery, full day) to THB 862,200 (Year 12)."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n\n**One-off fees:**\n- "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assessment fee: THB 5,000"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n- "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Placement fee: THB 30,000"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n- "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Security deposit: THB 60,000 (refundable)"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n- "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Registration fee: THB 110,000–160,000 depending on stage (non-refundable)"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n\n**What tuition covers:** "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Meals (except Years 12–13), world languages, trips and a 1:1 device for Years 3–11. Exam fees are extra."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n\n**Possible extra:** "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The school can require some students to take English as an Additional Language (EAL) or Learning Support (LS) programmes, which cost extra. If a student needs both, only the LS fee is charged."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n\nThe fee figures above come from third-party sites and don't fully agree with each other, so treat them as estimates. For confirmed numbers, download the official fee schedule from the school's "
          },
          {
            "citations": [],
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Admissions Procedure page"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at bangkokprep.ac.th, or contact the admissions team."
          }
        ],
